</a></span></div></div>
    <div class="cardColumn"><div class="views-field views-field-nothing"><span class="field-content"><a href="/additional-resources/spotlight/common-scams" class="card-item">
   <div><img src="/sites/investorgov/files/styles/card_image/public/2025-07/Red%20Flag.png?itok=8I1gsFgs" alt=""></div>
